Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,I worked all night. I now owe more\Nthan I did yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:09.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,Marlow needed the floodgates cranked\Nbefore the surge. Two cranks. My biggest job yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:15.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Nib bailed water with his helmet.\NSaid it was the best day of his life. He's seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:20.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two cranks earned. Then Marlow read the fees.\NLantern tax: three cranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.22,0:00:25.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,I did the math out loud. He smiled.\NCranks, my dear. Not math.
